lue_text":"Kiel \n Rassimov \n The Betrayer","links":[{"target_title":"Kiel","label":"Kiel","target_id":"huntik:page:4554","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Kiel","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4554"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"The Betrayer","label":"The Betrayer","target_id":"huntik:page:4562","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Betrayer","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4562"}]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"\"[[The Spiral War]]\"","value_text":"\"The Spiral War\"","links":[{"target_title":"The Spiral War","label":"The Spiral War","target_id":"huntik:page:8471","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Spiral_War","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A8471"}]}],"start":0,"end":204}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"This spell was used by [[Kiel]] during his final battle with [[Sophie Casterwill]] at the siege of the [[Fortress of Iron Will]]. He used it alongside [[Vulcana]] and [[Balenpyre]]'s flame blasts, but the attacks were redirected by [[Sorcerel|Powerbonded Sorcerel's]] Honorforce ability. {{source|The Spiral War}}\n\n[[Rassimov]] later used it during his final fight with [[Dante Vale]], however it was dodged by Dante who used [[Copykind]] to fire the spell back at him. {{source|The Spiral Mark}} \n\n[[The Betrayer]] used Stormflare during his fight with [[Dante Vale]]. {{source|Dante's Return}}\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Orange-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]","text":"This spell was used by Kiel during his final battle with Sophie Casterwill at the siege of the Fortress of Iron Will. He used it alongside Vulcana and Balenpyre's flame blasts, but the attacks were redirected by Powerbonded Sorcerel's Honorforce ability. [The Spiral War]\n\nRassimov later used it during his final fight with Dante Vale, however it was dodged by Dante who used Copykind to fire the spell back at him. [The Spiral Mark] \n\nThe Betrayer used Stormflare during his fight with Dante Vale. [Dante's Return]"}],"full_text":"Stormflare is a fire-based spell used by members of the Blood Spiral. The spell acts much like a magical flame-thrower coming from the user's hand, producing a beam of orange fire.\n\n== History ==\nThis spell was used by Kiel during his final battle with Sophie Casterwill at the siege of the Fortress of Iron Will. He used it alongside Vulcana and Balenpyre's flame blasts, but the attacks were redirected by Powerbonded Sorcerel's Honorforce ability. [The Spiral War]\n\nRassimov later used it during his final fight with Dante Vale, however it was dodged by Dante who used Copykind to fire the spell back at him. [The Spiral Mark] \n\nThe Betrayer used Stormflare during his fight with Dante Vale. [Dante's Return]","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox spell\n| image = File:S2E40_Volcana_Kiel_Balenpyre_Stormflare.png\n| aura  = Orange\n| class = Offensive\n| users = [[Kiel]] <br> [[Rassimov]] <br> [[The Betrayer]]\n| first = \"[[The Spiral War]]\"\n}}\n'''Stormflare''' is a fire-based spell used by members of the [[Blood Spiral]]. The spell acts much like a magical flame-thrower coming from the user's hand, producing a beam of orange fire.\n\n== History ==\nThis spell was used by [[Kiel]] during his final battle with [[Sophie Casterwill]] at the siege of the [[Fortress of Iron Will]]. He used it alongside [[Vulcana]] and [[Balenpyre]]'s flame blasts, but the attacks were redirected by [[Sorcerel|Powerbonded Sorcerel's]] Honorforce ability. {{source|The Spiral War}}\n\n[[Rassimov]] later used it during his final fight with [[Dante Vale]], however it was dodged by Dante who used [[Copykind]] to fire the spell back at him. {{source|The Spiral Mark}} \n\n[[The Betrayer]] used Stormflare during his fight with [[Dante Vale]]. {{source|Dante's Return}}\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Orange-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]","categories":["Blood Spiral magic","Magic","Offensive spells","Orange-aura spells"],"links":[{"target_title":"Kiel","label":"Kiel","target_id":"huntik:page:4554","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Kiel","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4554"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"The Betrayer","label":"The Betrayer","target_id":"huntik:page:4562","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Betrayer","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4562"},{"target_title":"The Spiral War","label":"The Spiral War","target_id":"huntik:page:8471","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Spiral_War","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A8471"},{"target_title":"Blood Spiral","label":"Blood Spiral","target_id":"huntik:page:3288","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Blood_Spiral","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3288"},{"target_title":"Kiel","label":"Kiel","target_id":"huntik:page:4554","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Kiel","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4554"},{"target_title":"Sophie Casterwill","label":"Sophie Casterwill","target_id":"huntik:page:2041","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sophie_Casterwill","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2041"},{"target_title":"Fortress of Iron Will","label":"Fortress of Iron Will","target_id":"huntik:page:4607","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Fortress_of_Iron_Will","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4607"},{"target_title":"Vulcana","label":"Vulcana","target_id":"huntik:page:4473","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Vulcana","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apag